---
layout: base.njk
eleventyComputed:
  title: "Multiplexers — Harness Census"
---
<h1>Agent Multiplexers</h1>
<p>Tools that orchestrate, manage, or run other coding agent harnesses (Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, etc.). These are not agents themselves — they coordinate agents.</p>
<p>{{ collections.multiplexer | size }} multiplexers catalogued.</p>

<table class="agent-table">
  <thead>
    <tr><th>Name</th><th>Maker</th><th>License</th><th>Stars</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {% set sorted = collections.multiplexer | sortByStars %}
    {% for mux in sorted %}
    <tr>
      <td><a href="{{ ('/agents/' ~ mux.data.slug ~ '/') | url }}">{{ mux.data.name }}</a></td>
      <td>{{ mux.data.maker or "—" }}</td>
      <td>{{ mux.data.license or "—" }}</td>
      <td>{{ mux.data.stars | starFmt }}</td>
    </tr>
    {% endfor %}
  </tbody>
</table>
